/*
 * Implements semantic validation for the concatenation operator in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported operand categories:
 *   - slices(mutable or const)
 *   - arrays(fixed-length)
 *   - class instances(via operator overloading)
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::binary::concat
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/binary/concat.yr
